{"term":"wilderness","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:940e6966146dda188b","definition":"Uncultivated and unsettled land in its natural state inhabited by wild animals and with vegetation growing wild; (countable) a tract of such land; a waste or wild.","example":"For ſtill he traueild through wide waſtfull ground, / That nought but deſert wilderneſſe ſhewed all around.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bushland","wildland","wilds","wasteland","wasteness","wastness"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"uncountable","wordFamily":["Bogong Peaks Wilderness","Byadbo Wilderness","call in the wilderness","cry in the wilderness","Jagungal Wilderness","nonwilderness","Pilot Wilderness","The Devils Wilderness","voice calling in the wilderness","voice crying in the wilderness","voice in the wilderness","wilderness camp","wilderness program","Wilderness Road","wilderness therapy","wilderness treatment center","wildernessy","wilderpee"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wilderness#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:3bd05673f732556484","definition":"A place other than land (for example, the air or sea) that is uncared for, and therefore devoted to disorder or wildness.","example":"For now I ſtand as one vpon a rocke, / Inuirond with a wildernes of ſea, / VVho markes the vvaxing tide, grovv vvaue by vvaue, / Expecting euer vvhen ſome enuious ſurge, / VVill in his briniſh bovvels ſvvallow him.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bushland","wild","wilderness","wildland"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"broadly","register":"broadly, countable","wordFamily":["Bogong Peaks Wilderness","Byadbo Wilderness","call in the wilderness","cry in the wilderness","Jagungal Wilderness","nonwilderness","Pilot Wilderness","The Devils Wilderness","voice calling in the wilderness","voice crying in the wilderness","voice in the wilderness","wilderness camp","wilderness program","Wilderness Road","wilderness therapy","wilderness treatment center","wildernessy","wilderpee"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wilderness#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:b2c9fbc006e8552714","definition":"An ornamental part of a garden or park cultivated with trees and often a maze to evoke a natural wilderness.","example":"And now with nerves new-brac'd and ſpirits chear'd / We tread the wilderneſs, whoſe well-roll'd walks / With curvature of ſlow and eaſy ſweep, / Deception innocent—give ample ſpace / To narrow bounds.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bushland","wild","wilderness","wildland"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"broadly","register":"broadly, countable","wordFamily":["Bogong Peaks Wilderness","Byadbo Wilderness","call in the wilderness","cry in the wilderness","Jagungal Wilderness","nonwilderness","Pilot Wilderness","The Devils Wilderness","voice calling in the wilderness","voice crying in the wilderness","voice in the wilderness","wilderness camp","wilderness program","Wilderness Road","wilderness therapy","wilderness treatment center","wildernessy","wilderpee"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wilderness#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:b3566c15a19bad5676","definition":"Unrefinedness; wildness.","example":"What ſhould I thinke, / Heauen ſhield my Mother plaid my Father faire: / For ſuch a warped ſlip of wilderneſſe / Nere iſſu'd from his blood.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bushland","wild","wilderness","wildland"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"broadly, obsolete","register":"broadly, obsolete, uncountable","wordFamily":["Bogong Peaks Wilderness","Byadbo Wilderness","call in the wilderness","cry in the wilderness","Jagungal Wilderness","nonwilderness","Pilot Wilderness","The Devils Wilderness","voice calling in the wilderness","voice crying in the wilderness","voice in the wilderness","wilderness camp","wilderness program","Wilderness Road","wilderness therapy","wilderness treatment center","wildernessy","wilderpee"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wilderness#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:8105d8b4016f9d42da","definition":"Chiefly followed by of: a bewildering flock or throng; a large, often jumbled, collection of things.","example":"Tuball. One of them ſhewed me a ring that hee had of your daughter for a Monkey. / Shy[lock]. Out vpon her: thou tortur'ſt me Tuball, it was my Turkies, I had it of Leah when I was a Batchellor: I would not haue giuen it for a wilderneſſe of Monkies.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bushland","wild","wilderness","wildland"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"figuratively","register":"countable, figuratively, uncountable","wordFamily":["Bogong Peaks Wilderness","Byadbo Wilderness","call in the wilderness","cry in the wilderness","Jagungal Wilderness","nonwilderness","Pilot Wilderness","The Devils Wilderness","voice calling in the wilderness","voice crying in the wilderness","voice in the wilderness","wilderness camp","wilderness program","Wilderness Road","wilderness therapy","wilderness treatment center","wildernessy","wilderpee"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wilderness#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:6d2ee1adde43291739","definition":"A place or situation that is bewildering and in which one may get lost.","example":"As I walk'd through the wilderneſs of this world, I lighted on a certain place, where was a Denn; And I laid me down in that place to ſleep: And as I ſlept I dreamed a Dream.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bushland","wild","wilderness","wildland"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"figuratively","register":"countable, figuratively, uncountable","wordFamily":["Bogong Peaks Wilderness","Byadbo Wilderness","call in the wilderness","cry in the wilderness","Jagungal Wilderness","nonwilderness","Pilot Wilderness","The Devils Wilderness","voice calling in the wilderness","voice crying in the wilderness","voice in the wilderness","wilderness camp","wilderness program","Wilderness Road","wilderness therapy","wilderness treatment center","wildernessy","wilderpee"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wilderness#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:25561175d5c7dfc68d","definition":"Preceded by in the: a situation of disfavour or lack of recognition; (specifically, politics) of a politician, political party, etc.: a situation of being out of office.","example":"After the firm establishment of the Irish Free State, [Winston] Churchill would continue to hold office until the depression. Then, he found himself in the political wilderness. But, unlike [David] Lloyd George, he would not find himself tripping to Berchtesgaden to prostrate himself before Adolf Hitler in admiration. Perhaps he had learned something from Michael Collins—never bend the knee to the tyrant.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bushland","wild","wilderness","wildland"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"figuratively","register":"countable, figuratively, uncountable","wordFamily":["Bogong Peaks Wilderness","Byadbo Wilderness","call in the wilderness","cry in the wilderness","Jagungal Wilderness","nonwilderness","Pilot Wilderness","The Devils Wilderness","voice calling in the wilderness","voice crying in the wilderness","voice in the wilderness","wilderness camp","wilderness program","Wilderness Road","wilderness therapy","wilderness treatment center","wildernessy","wilderpee"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":